{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56800","headline":"赵阿奴鱼背字（题拟） · 不详","name":"赵阿奴鱼背字（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三曾到杨府，五转归马湖。\n身上千斤肉，今还赵阿奴。\n（见何光远《监诫录》卷十《鱼还肉》）（〖1〗《监诫录》云：「天复初，任可芝任戎州刺史日，有鱼人赵阿奴，善钓大鱼。\n……其年秋，忽获一络子鱼，果重千斤，背上自然有字，其文金色，观者感伤。\n赵阿奴因此从军，遂改钓业。\n其大鱼背上字云〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}